9 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.45 kg (0.9 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 640 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  640  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_GLO_Orin_Bhaalist_Dagger_Netherstone</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_GLO_Orin_Bhaalist_Dagger_Netherstone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_GLO_Orin_Bhaalist_Dagger_Netherstone\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">7051fd5c-d777-457e-9aaf-e007b4cbbb55</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7051fd5c-d777-457e-9aaf-e007b4cbbb55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:7051fd5c-d777-457e-9aaf-e007b4cbbb55\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_WYR_Orin_Bhaalist_Dagger</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_WYR_Orin_Bhaalist_Dagger+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_WYR_Orin_Bhaalist_Dagger+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike\" title=\"True Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-True_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-True_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-True_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-True_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/True_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike\" title=\"True Strike\">True Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cast as a cantrip (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bound_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Bound Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bound Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bound_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Bound Weapon (Condition)\">Bound Weapon</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> +1 (Off-Hand Only)</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Improved_Critical\" title=\"Improved Critical\">Improved Critical</a></dt><dd>The number you need to <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">roll</a> a <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_Hit\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Critical Hit\">Critical Hit</a> while attacking is reduced by 1. This effect can stack.</dd></dl>\n<p><em>Main Hand Only</em>\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Exploit_Weakness\" title=\"Exploit Weakness\">Exploit Weakness</a></dt><dd>Creatures hit with this weapon receive <a href=\"/wiki/Vulnerability\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vulnerability\">Vulnerability</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Piercing_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Piercing_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Piercing\" title=\"Piercing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">Piercing</span></a> damage.</dd></dl>\n<p><em>Off-Hand Only</em>\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_Riposte\" title=\"True Strike Riposte\">True Strike Riposte</a></dt><dd>When a creature misses you with a melee attack, you may retaliate and gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"True Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/True_Strike_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/True_Strike_(Condition)\" title=\"True Strike (Condition)\">True Strike</a>.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piercing Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Piercing_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piercing_Strike\" title=\"Piercing Strike\">Piercing Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Stab an enemy and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaping Wounds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Open_Wound_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gaping_Wounds_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaping Wounds (Condition)\">Gaping Wounds</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Bound_Weapon\"> Condition: Bound Weapon </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bound_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Bound Weapon (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bound Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Bound_Weapon_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bound_Weapon_(Condition)\" title=\"Bound Weapon (Condition)\">Bound Weapon</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Ritually bound to its wielder.</li>\n<li>The weapon cannot be knocked out of the wielder's hand, and automatically returns to its wielder when <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">thrown</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bhaal_Temple\" title=\"Bhaal Temple\">Bhaal Temple</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;61&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;1004</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/38px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/50px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png/25px-Portrait_Orin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Portrait_Orin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a> during the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Get_Orin%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Get Orin's Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Get Orin's Netherstone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Get_Orin%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Get Orin's Netherstone\">Get Orin's Netherstone</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When this item is looted it breaks into <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orin%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Orin's Netherstone\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Orin%27s_Netherstone_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orin%27s_Netherstone\" title=\"Orin's Netherstone\">Orin's Netherstone</a>.</li>\n<li>In-game this is, in terms of grammar, incorrectly labelled as <i>\"Netherstone-Pomelled Bloodthirst\"</i>.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Improved Critical:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Improved Critical also applies to all attacks, not just those made with the corresponding weapon.</li>\n<li>Improved Critical stacks with features that increase critical hit range. This includes multiple copies of Improved Critical itself (with both <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Dead_Shot\" title=\"The Dead Shot\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Longbow_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Dead_Shot\" title=\"The Dead Shot\">The Dead Shot</a> equipped) or similar features like <a href=\"/wiki/Organ_Rearranger\" title=\"Organ Rearranger\">Organ Rearranger</a> (from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knife_of_the_Undermountain_King\" title=\"Knife of the Undermountain King\">Knife of the Undermountain King</a>). For a full list, see <a href=\"/wiki/Critical_hit#Reducing_critical_threshold\" title=\"Critical hit\">Reducing critical threshold</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><i>Regarding Exploit Weakness:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Exploit Weakness is only applied by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Bloodthirst_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bloodthirst\" title=\"Bloodthirst\">Bloodthirst</a> and only when used in melee combat; <a href=\"/wiki/Throw\" title=\"Throw\">throwing</a> this weapon does not apply the passive.</li></ul>\n<p><i>Regarding True Strike Riposte:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The retalitory attack granted by True Strike Riposte expends a <span style=\"display: inline-block; height: 20px; width: 20px; margin-left: -3px; margin-top: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a> resource.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 185.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 183.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg/275px-Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg/413px-Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg/550px-Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg/275px-Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"184\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Jane-katsubo-dag.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200240\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.183 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.198 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 6313/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 98060/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24760/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2598/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.066/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1966305/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  167.353      1 -total\n 80.96%  135.495      1 Template:WeaponPage\n 18.84%   31.530     19 Template:Icon_text\n 18.83%   31.520      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 18.61%   31.152      